INTRODUCTION. THANK YOU, MR.

00:36:33.457 --> 00:36:35.593
PRESIDENT. AND IT'S TRULY MY

00:36:35.660 --> 00:36:38.829
DISTINCT HONOR TO INTRODUCE

00:36:38.896 --> 00:36:39.864
SOMEONE WHO REALLY NEEDS NO

00:36:39.931 --> 00:36:42.433
INTRODUCTION, WHOSE REPUTATION

00:36:42.500 --> 00:36:45.703
PRECEDES HIMSELF AND DIVIDUAL,

00:36:45.770 --> 00:36:46.537
WHO EMBODIES STATESMANSHIP,

00:36:46.604 --> 00:36:49.273
LEADER SHIP COLLABORATION,

00:36:49.340 --> 00:36:53.110
BIPARTISAN LEADERSHIP HERE IN

00:36:53.177 --> 00:36:56.414
THE STATE OF CALIFORNIA, A

00:36:56.480 --> 00:36:57.582
INDIVIDUAL WHO IS KNOWN FOR HIS

00:36:57.648 --> 00:37:00.651
ORATORIO KHÓ SPLENDOR AND HIS

00:37:00.718 --> 00:37:03.487
SARTORIAL EXCELLENCE. NONE OTHER

00:37:03.554 --> 00:37:07.124
THAN SPEAKER EMERITUS WILLIE

00:37:07.191 --> 00:37:10.628
LOUIS BROWN JR FOR THE VERY

00:37:10.695 --> 00:37:11.829
FIRST AFRICAN AMERICAN SPEAKER

00:37:11.896 --> 00:37:13.731
OF THE CALIFORNIA STATE ASSEMBLY

00:37:13.798 --> 00:37:18.803
AND THE. FIRST AFRICAN-AMERICAN

00:37:18.869 --> 00:37:22.807
MAYOR OF THE CITY OF SAN

00:37:22.873 --> 00:37:23.908
FRANCISCO. HE IS REFERRED TO AS

00:37:23.975 --> 00:37:26.010
THE KING KONG OF CALIFORNIA.

00:37:26.077 --> 00:37:29.013
POLITICS. MR. BROWN IS CONTINUES

00:37:29.080 --> 00:37:32.250
TO HAVE A LONG AND LEGENDARY

00:37:32.316 --> 00:37:35.453
CAREER. MR. BROWN WAS BORN IN

00:37:35.519 --> 00:37:36.587
MINEOLA, TEXAS. A VERY HUMBLE

00:37:36.654 --> 00:37:40.191
BEGINNINGS, AND HE LEARNED HIS

00:37:40.257 --> 00:37:42.326
TREMENDOUS WORK ETHIC FROM HIS

00:37:42.393 --> 00:37:46.397
GRANDMOTHER. HIS FIRST JOB AS A

00:37:46.464 --> 00:37:48.366
YOUNG BOY WAS SHINING SHOES IN A

00:37:48.432 --> 00:37:50.368
WHITE ONLY BARBER SHOP. HE LATER

00:37:50.434 --> 00:37:52.903
WENT ON TO WORK AS A JANITOR, A

00:37:52.970 --> 00:37:56.040
FRY COOK, AND A FIELD HAND, AND

00:37:56.107 --> 00:37:57.041
UPON GRADUATING FROM HIGH

00:37:57.108 --> 00:37:59.510
SCHOOL, HE DECIDED TO MOVE TO

00:37:59.577 --> 00:38:01.312
CALIFORNIA TO SAN FRANCISCO TO

00:38:01.379 --> 00:38:03.447
LOOK FOR A BETTER OPPORTUNITY.

00:38:03.514 --> 00:38:06.350
IT WAS HIS INTENTIONS TO GO TO

00:38:06.417 --> 00:38:08.185
STANFORD, BUT THEY DIDN'T ACCEPT

00:38:08.252 --> 00:38:10.521
HIM IN STANFORD. BUT LUCKY FOR

00:38:10.588 --> 00:38:11.722
MR. BROWN, THE INDIVIDUAL WHO

00:38:11.789 --> 00:38:13.257
WAS ON THE INTERVIEWING PANEL

00:38:13.324 --> 00:38:14.859
STRONGLY RECOMMENDED HIM FOR SAN

00:38:14.925 --> 00:38:17.428
FRANCISCO STATE, WHERE HE WENT

00:38:17.495 --> 00:38:20.364
ON TO GRADUATE THERE AND

00:38:20.431 --> 00:38:23.401
ESTABLISH HIMSELF ON CAMPUS

00:38:23.467 --> 00:38:28.239
ACTIVITIES. AND THEN WENT ON TO

00:38:28.305 --> 00:38:30.007
GET A LAW DEGREE. AND AS YOU

00:38:30.074 --> 00:38:31.142
TALK TO MR. BROWN, HIS

00:38:31.208 --> 00:38:32.910
INTENTIONS NEVER WAS TO BE A

00:38:32.977 --> 00:38:35.079
LAWYER. IT WAS TO BE A MATH

00:38:35.146 --> 00:38:36.681
TEACHER. AND ONE OF THE REASONS

00:38:36.747 --> 00:38:38.883
HE ENROLLED IN LAW SCHOOL WAS TO

00:38:38.949 --> 00:38:39.917
AVOID THE DRAFT. AND HE

00:38:39.984 --> 00:38:42.553
GRADUATED FROM HASTINGS LAW

00:38:42.620 --> 00:38:43.721
SCHOOL AND QUICKLY OPENED A LAW

00:38:43.788 --> 00:38:46.424
PRACTICE. AND HE REPRESENTED

00:38:46.490 --> 00:38:49.727
PIMPS, PROSTITUTES AND OTHER

00:38:49.794 --> 00:38:52.697
CLIENTS THAT MORE PROMINENT LAW

00:38:52.763 --> 00:38:54.465
LAW FIRMS DIDN'T WANT TO HAVE

00:38:54.532 --> 00:38:57.168
ANYTHING TO DO WITH. IT WAS

00:38:57.234 --> 00:38:59.670
THROUGH THIS ACTIVITY THAT HE

00:38:59.737 --> 00:39:00.738
GARNERED HIS STRONG PASSION FOR

00:39:00.805 --> 00:39:07.044
CIVIL RIGHTS, EQUALITY, AND

00:39:07.111 --> 00:39:08.145
MAKING SURE THAT PEOPLE, THE

00:39:08.212 --> 00:39:10.915
UNDERREPRESENTED AND UNDERDOGS,

00:39:10.981 --> 00:39:13.884
HAD A VOICE. HE WAS. THEN HE

00:39:13.951 --> 00:39:17.455
SOUGHT ELECTED OFFICIAL OFFICE,

00:39:17.521 --> 00:39:20.624
I SHOULD SAY. AND IN 1962, HE

00:39:20.691 --> 00:39:21.759
WAS UNSUCCESSFUL, BUT A PASTOR

00:39:21.826 --> 00:39:24.061
RAISED MONEY FOR HIM, ALL OF A

00:39:24.128 --> 00:39:27.164
WHOPPING $700 FOR HIS CAMPAIGN

00:39:27.231 --> 00:39:28.332
AND THE CHURCH PASSING THE HAT.

00:39:28.399 --> 00:39:30.367
I MEAN, THAT WAS A LOT BACK THEN

00:39:30.434 --> 00:39:33.704
AND, LATER RAN TWO YEARS LATER

00:39:33.771 --> 00:39:34.772
AND WAS SUCCESSFULLY ELECTED TO

00:39:34.839 --> 00:39:37.041
THE CALIFORNIA ASSEMBLY IN 1964.

00:39:37.108 --> 00:39:40.644
AND HIS TENURE, AS WE ALL KNOW,

00:39:40.711 --> 00:39:42.513
SPANNED SEVEN GOVERNORS, FROM

00:39:42.580 --> 00:39:45.883
GOVERNOR PETE, PAT BROWN TO

00:39:45.950 --> 00:39:46.817
GOVERNOR ARNOLD SCHWARZENEGGER.

00:39:46.884 --> 00:39:50.287
MR. BROWN, AS WE ALL KNOW, HOLDS

00:39:50.354 --> 00:39:51.388
THE RECORD FOR THE LONGEST

00:39:51.455 --> 00:39:53.357
SERVING SPEAKER IN THE STATE

00:39:53.424 --> 00:39:56.093
HISTORY. AND UNDER CURRENT TERM

00:39:56.160 --> 00:39:57.228
LIMITS, WE KNOW THAT WILL NEVER

00:39:57.294 --> 00:39:59.830
BE BROKE AND FORTUNATELY AND

00:39:59.897 --> 00:40:00.765
UNFORTUNATELY, HE'S THE REASON

00:40:00.831 --> 00:40:03.033
WHY WE HAVE TERM LIMITS TODAY.

00:40:03.100 --> 00:40:06.303
BECAUSE THEY DIDN'T KNOW HOW TO

00:40:06.370 --> 00:40:07.471
BEAT WILLIE BROWN. SO THEY CHOSE

00:40:07.538 --> 00:40:09.807
TO PASS TERM LIMITS AND END

00:40:09.874 --> 00:40:13.043
THEIR OWN CAREERS JUST TO, YOU

00:40:13.110 --> 00:40:14.178
KNOW, DIMINISH WHAT HE WAS DOING

00:40:14.245 --> 00:40:16.213
DURING HIS TENURE IN THE

00:40:16.280 --> 00:40:17.314
LEGISLATURE. MR. BROWN LEFT HIS

00:40:17.381 --> 00:40:19.483
MARK ON EVERY ASPECT OF PUBLIC

00:40:19.550 --> 00:40:23.087
POLICY IMPACTING CALIFORNIA. HIS

00:40:23.154 --> 00:40:23.988
LEADERSHIP RESULTED IN

00:40:24.054 --> 00:40:26.423
LEGISLATION THAT BANNED SEMI

00:40:26.490 --> 00:40:29.760
AUTOMATIC WEAPONS, GAINED STATE

00:40:29.827 --> 00:40:30.761
DIVESTMENT FROM SOUTH AFRICA,

00:40:30.828 --> 00:40:33.597
ENDED THE CRIMINALIZATION OF

00:40:33.664 --> 00:40:36.467
HOMOSEXUALITY, AND CREATED

00:40:36.534 --> 00:40:37.468
GREATER STABILITY IN OUR

00:40:37.535 --> 00:40:38.469
EDUCATION SYSTEM THROUGH THE

00:40:38.536 --> 00:40:40.337
SCHOOL FINANCE REFORM. HE ALSO

00:40:40.404 --> 00:40:44.041
HELPED ESTABLISH THE LEGISLATIVE

00:40:44.108 --> 00:40:45.776
BLACK CAUCUS AND ALL THE OTHER

00:40:45.843 --> 00:40:48.412
ETHNIC CAUCUSES THAT EXIST TODAY

00:40:48.479 --> 00:40:50.014
IN THE LEGISLATURE. DUE TO HIS

00:40:50.080 --> 00:40:53.517
TREMENDOUS LEADERSHIP AND 30

00:40:53.584 --> 00:40:57.087
YEARS AFTER LEAVING THE

00:40:57.154 --> 00:40:58.189
ASSEMBLY, HIS IMPACT IS STILL

00:40:58.255 --> 00:41:01.325
FELT AND SEEN TODAY. BASED ON

00:41:01.392 --> 00:41:03.494
THE NUMBER OF STAFF PEOPLE WHO

00:41:03.561 --> 00:41:04.728
STILL WORK IN THIS BUILDING, OR

00:41:04.795 --> 00:41:06.864
THE NUMBER OF INDIVIDUALS WHO

00:41:06.931 --> 00:41:07.965
ARE ACROSS THE STREET AS

00:41:08.032 --> 00:41:10.100
LOBBYISTS, AS CONSULTANTS OR

00:41:10.167 --> 00:41:10.534
GOVERNMENT RELATIONS

00:41:10.601 --> 00:41:14.405
INDIVIDUALS, AND I CAN GO ON AND

00:41:14.471 --> 00:41:15.539
ON AND ON ABOUT THOSE

00:41:15.606 --> 00:41:16.807
INDIVIDUALS AND WHAT THEY DO

00:41:16.874 --> 00:41:18.742
AND, AND, AND THE IMPACT. MR.

00:41:18.809 --> 00:41:22.847
BROWN HAD ON THEIR CAREERS

00:41:22.913 --> 00:41:26.750
FOLLOWING HIS ROLE AS SPEAKER OF

00:41:26.817 --> 00:41:27.785
THE ASSEMBLY, MR. BROWN

00:41:27.852 --> 00:41:28.686
CONTINUED HIS GROUNDBREAKING

00:41:28.752 --> 00:41:30.921
CAREER IN PUBLIC SERVICE AS

00:41:30.988 --> 00:41:31.922
BECOMING THE FIRST AFRICAN

00:41:31.989 --> 00:41:34.625
AMERICAN MAYOR OF THE CITY OF

00:41:34.692 --> 00:41:35.726
SAN FRANCISCO. AS MAYOR, HE LED

00:41:35.793 --> 00:41:36.794
THE EFFORT TO REBUILD

00:41:36.861 --> 00:41:37.828
CALIFORNIA'S BUSIEST TRANSIT

00:41:37.895 --> 00:41:40.564
SYSTEM, PIONEERED THE USE OF

00:41:40.631 --> 00:41:41.665
BOND MEASURES TO BUILD

00:41:41.732 --> 00:41:43.767
AFFORDABLE HOUSING, AND CREATED

00:41:43.834 --> 00:41:46.704
A MODEL JUVENILE JUSTICE SYSTEM.

00:41:46.770 --> 00:41:47.705
THESE ACCOMPLISHMENTS ARE JUST A

00:41:47.771 --> 00:41:51.342
BRIEF GLIMPSE OF THE VARIETY AND

00:41:51.408 --> 00:41:53.844
SCOPE OF A FORWARD THINKING

00:41:53.911 --> 00:41:54.945
IDEAS THAT WERE REALIZED UNDER

00:41:55.012 --> 00:41:57.781
HIS LEADERSHIP. TODAY, THE

00:41:57.848 --> 00:42:01.085
ASSEMBLY HAS DECLARED TODAY,

00:42:01.151 --> 00:42:04.655
WILLIE BROWN DAY IN RECOGNITION

00:42:04.722 --> 00:42:05.789
OF HIS MANY ACCOMPLISHMENTS, AS

00:42:05.856 --> 00:42:08.058
WELL AS MR. BROWN'S UNRELATED,

00:42:08.125 --> 00:42:09.026
UNRELENTING DEDICATION TO A

00:42:09.093 --> 00:42:11.695
BETTER CALIFORNIA FOR ALL.

00:42:11.762 --> 00:42:12.730
EARLIER TODAY, THERE WAS A

00:42:12.796 --> 00:42:15.432
RECEPTION HERE IN THE CAPITOL,

00:42:15.499 --> 00:42:18.869
AND IT WAS ATTENDED BY THE WHO'S

00:42:18.936 --> 00:42:20.104
WHO OF FORMER ELECTED OFFICIALS,

00:42:20.170 --> 00:42:23.507
STAFFERS, YOU NAME IT, AS MANY

00:42:23.574 --> 00:42:25.910
ARE ON THE FLOOR TODAY. AND I

00:42:25.976 --> 00:42:27.077
DON'T KNOW ANYONE ELSE WHO COULD

00:42:27.144 --> 00:42:28.846
PROBABLY GATHER THAT MANY

00:42:28.913 --> 00:42:29.980
CURRENT OR FORMER MEMBERS TO PAY

00:42:30.047 --> 00:42:33.250
TRIBUTE TO AN INDIVIDUAL SUCH AS

00:42:33.317 --> 00:42:36.787
MR. BROWN, AND I WAS HONORED TO

00:42:36.854 --> 00:42:39.323
MEET MR. BROWN IN 1988 AS A

00:42:39.390 --> 00:42:41.859
YOUNG, ASPIRING INDIVIDUAL

00:42:41.926 --> 00:42:42.927
WANTING TO GET INVOLVED IN

00:42:42.993 --> 00:42:44.128
POLITICS, AND IT WAS THROUGH HIS

00:42:44.194 --> 00:42:45.763
FORMER STAFF, MY LATE FRAT

00:42:45.829 --> 00:42:46.864
BROTHER DARNELL COOLEY, WHO

00:42:46.931 --> 00:42:50.167
INTRODUCED ME TO MR. BROWN

00:42:50.234 --> 00:42:51.368
DURING A BAY PARTY CONVENTION

00:42:51.435 --> 00:42:53.771
AND I AND I WON'T SAY A

00:42:53.837 --> 00:42:56.473
FRIENDSHIP WAS FORMED, BUT A

00:42:56.540 --> 00:42:57.508
MUTUAL RESPECT. AND AS AN

00:42:57.574 --> 00:42:59.443
INDIVIDUAL WHO WAS BORN IN

00:42:59.510 --> 00:43:00.577
TEXAS, I WAS EMBARRASSED TO TELL

00:43:00.644 --> 00:43:03.747
FOLKS I WAS BORN IN TEXAS

00:43:03.814 --> 00:43:06.283
BECAUSE TEXAS REPRESENTED SO

00:43:06.350 --> 00:43:07.384
MANY NEGATIVE THINGS SLAVERY,

00:43:07.451 --> 00:43:10.521
RACISM. BUT NOT UNTIL I MET MR.

00:43:10.587 --> 00:43:11.522
BROWN AND SAW HIS

00:43:11.588 --> 00:43:13.991
ACCOMPLISHMENTS. AND HE WAS FROM

00:43:14.058 --> 00:43:15.125
MINEOLA, TEXAS, AND I DIDN'T

00:43:15.192 --> 00:43:16.226
EVEN KNOW WHERE THE HELL THAT

00:43:16.293 --> 00:43:20.130
WAS. BUT IT MADE ME PROUD TO SAY

00:43:20.197 --> 00:43:21.398
I TOO, WAS FROM TEXAS, AND I'VE

00:43:21.465 --> 00:43:23.267
CARRIED THAT BADGE OF HONOR EVER

00:43:23.334 --> 00:43:26.637
SINCE I'VE MET MR. BROWN AND I'M

00:43:26.704 --> 00:43:27.771
HONORED TO NOW CALL HIM A

00:43:27.838 --> 00:43:30.674
MENTOR. AND I WAS DEEPLY MOVED

00:43:30.741 --> 00:43:33.143
WHEN I GOT ELECTED IN A SPECIAL

00:43:33.210 --> 00:43:35.045
ELECTION IN OH NINE. AND I CAME

00:43:35.112 --> 00:43:37.648
IN BY MYSELF AND MY STAFF TOLD

00:43:37.715 --> 00:43:39.783
ME, THEY SAID, MR. BROWN WANTS

00:43:39.850 --> 00:43:41.018
TO MEET YOU FOR LUNCH IN SAN

00:43:41.085 --> 00:43:43.620
FRANCISCO, AND I DIDN'T BELIEVE

00:43:43.687 --> 00:43:46.890
IT. AND BUT IT WAS TRUE. I

00:43:46.957 --> 00:43:50.227
QUICKLY GOT IN THE CAR AND DROVE

00:43:50.294 --> 00:43:51.395
TO THE FOUR SEASONS, WHERE WE

00:43:51.462 --> 00:43:53.597
HAD LUNCH THAT DAY, AND I

00:43:53.664 --> 00:43:55.466
GLEANED SO MUCH FROM MR. BROWN

00:43:55.532 --> 00:43:57.868
AND HE CLEARLY TOLD ME, HE SAYS,

00:43:57.935 --> 00:44:00.170
BRADFORD, THIS BUSINESS IS NOT

00:44:00.237 --> 00:44:02.006
HOW SMART YOU ARE. IT'S ABOUT

00:44:02.072 --> 00:44:03.707
RELATIONSHIPS. IT'S ABOUT

00:44:03.774 --> 00:44:07.244
KNOWING YOUR COLLEAGUES, KNOWING

00:44:07.311 --> 00:44:08.445
THE ISSUES. AND I'VE HEARD SOME

00:44:08.512 --> 00:44:10.748
OF THE BEST. WILLIE BROWN

00:44:10.814 --> 00:44:13.650
STORIES, NOT FROM DEMOCRATS, BUT

00:44:13.717 --> 00:44:14.752
FROM REPUBLICANS LIKE THE LATE

00:44:14.818 --> 00:44:17.254
BILL DUPLISSEA, WHO LOVED WILLIE

00:44:17.321 --> 00:44:21.191
BROWN. BUILD A POLICY, WAS A ONE

00:44:21.258 --> 00:44:22.259
TERM ASSEMBLYMAN, AND WILLIE

00:44:22.326 --> 00:44:24.862
BROWN TOOK HIM OUT. BUT THEY

00:44:24.928 --> 00:44:25.896
WERE STILL FRIENDSHIP FRIENDS

00:44:25.963 --> 00:44:27.898
UNTIL THE DAY HE DIED. SO THIS

00:44:27.965 --> 00:44:28.899
BUSINESS IS ABOUT RELATIONSHIPS,

00:44:28.966 --> 00:44:31.869
FOLKS, AND MR. BROWN EPITOMIZES

00:44:31.935 --> 00:44:32.970
THAT BETTER THAN NOBODY ELSE.

00:44:33.037 --> 00:44:34.938
THAT I KNOW. AND MY 20 PLUS

00:44:35.005 --> 00:44:37.474
YEARS OF BEING AN ELECTED

00:44:37.541 --> 00:44:38.542
OFFICIAL, AND I'M HONORED TO

00:44:38.609 --> 00:44:39.777
CALL HIM A MENTOR. SO PLEASE

00:44:39.843 --> 00:44:41.845
JOIN ME IN WELCOMING SPEAKER

00:44:41.912 --> 00:44:43.113
EMERITUS WILLIE LEWIS BROWN TO

00:44:43.180 --> 00:44:53.257
THE CALIFORNIA STATE SENATE.

00:44:53.323 --> 00:44:54.258
SPEAKER, THANK YOU, SENATOR

00:44:54.324 --> 00:44:57.761
BRADFORD. WE HAVE MICROPHONES UP

00:44:57.828 --> 00:44:58.829
FROM SOME OTHER COLLEAGUES WHO

00:44:58.896 --> 00:45:00.597
WOULD LIKE TO BE HEARD ON THIS,

00:45:00.664 --> 00:45:03.700
ACCOMPLISHMENT. WE'LL START

00:45:03.767 --> 00:45:05.436
FIRST WITH OUR FORMER PRO TEM

00:45:05.502 --> 00:45:07.337
SENATOR ATKINS, FOLLOWED BY

00:45:07.404 --> 00:45:08.372
SENATOR WIENER, FOLLOWED BY

00:45:08.439 --> 00:45:10.707
SENATOR UMBERG. SENATOR ATKINS.

00:45:10.774 --> 00:45:11.775
THANK YOU, MR. PRESIDENT. WELL,

00:45:11.842 --> 00:45:14.912
IT'S HARD TO ADD TO WHAT THE

00:45:14.978 --> 00:45:17.481
SENATOR FROM GARDENA HAS SAID,

00:45:17.548 --> 00:45:19.416
AND I THINK YOU COVERED A LOT OF

00:45:19.483 --> 00:45:21.151
BASES THERE, RESPECTFULLY. BUT I

00:45:21.218 --> 00:45:23.087
WANT TO RISE TO SAY THANK YOU,

00:45:23.153 --> 00:45:24.855
AS A FORMER SPEAKER FOR, IT'S

00:45:24.922 --> 00:45:28.058
QUITE AN HONOR TO EVEN BE IN

00:45:28.125 --> 00:45:29.960
YOUR PRESENCE. I REMEMBER WHEN I

00:45:30.027 --> 00:45:31.428
WAS SWORN IN, YOU WERE THERE. I

00:45:31.495 --> 00:45:33.397
THANK YOU FOR ALL OF THE ADVICE

00:45:33.464 --> 00:45:35.165
OVER THE YEARS, JOHN PEREZ WAS

00:45:35.232 --> 00:45:37.935
MY SPEAKER. WE ALL KNOW THESE

00:45:38.001 --> 00:45:39.069
THINGS, BUT MR. BROWN IS THE

00:45:39.136 --> 00:45:42.573
SPEAKER. AND SO HIS DESK REMAINS

00:45:42.639 --> 00:45:45.008
ON THE ASSEMBLY FLOOR, ONE OF

00:45:45.075 --> 00:45:48.045
ONLY ONE OTHER PERSON THAT HAS A

00:45:48.112 --> 00:45:50.247
DESK THAT IS NOT OCCUPIED ON THE

00:45:50.314 --> 00:45:53.250
ASSEMBLY FLOOR. AND I JUST WANT

00:45:53.317 --> 00:45:56.653
TO SAY YOU ARE ICONIC, I FELT

00:45:56.720 --> 00:45:57.821
THE WELCOME WHEN I WOULD ARRIVE,

00:45:57.888 --> 00:46:00.824
EITHER AS SPEAKER OR PRO TEM IN

00:46:00.891 --> 00:46:01.825
SAN FRANCISCO. ALWAYS AN

00:46:01.892 --> 00:46:04.495
INVITATION TO JOIN YOU FOR LUNCH

00:46:04.561 --> 00:46:07.131
OR COFFEE. AND I APPRECIATE SO

00:46:07.197 --> 00:46:10.234
MUCH YOUR ADVICE AND THOUGHTS,

00:46:10.300 --> 00:46:11.201
PARTICULARLY THE HUMOROUS ONES.

00:46:11.268 --> 00:46:14.938
OVER THE YEARS. AND I JUST RISE

00:46:15.005 --> 00:46:16.173
TO SAY THANK YOU, SIR, AND IT'S

00:46:16.240 --> 00:46:18.208
AN HONOR TO HAVE YOU ON OUR

00:46:18.275 --> 00:46:19.376
SENATE FLOOR TODAY. THANK YOU,

00:46:19.443 --> 00:46:23.046
SENATOR ATKINS. WE WILL NEXT

00:46:23.113 --> 00:46:24.815
RECOGNIZE THE SENATOR FROM SAN

00:46:24.882 --> 00:46:26.783
FRANCISCO, FOLLOWED BY THE

00:46:26.850 --> 00:46:27.918
SENATOR FROM FULLERTON, FOLLOWED

00:46:27.985 --> 00:46:30.053
BY THE SENATOR FROM LOS ANGELES.

00:46:30.120 --> 00:46:31.755
SENATOR WIENER. THANK YOU, MR.

00:46:31.822 --> 00:46:34.224
PRESIDENT. SO I THINK A LOT OF

00:46:34.291 --> 00:46:36.493
TIMES WHEN SPEAKER BROWN COMES,

00:46:36.560 --> 00:46:39.429
